### Phase 9 — Blockchain integrity API (admin JWT required)
### Store Claim Hash
POST http://localhost:5001/api/blockchain/claims/8/store
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Verify Claim Hash
GET http://localhost:5001/api/blockchain/claims/8/verify
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN

### Get Claim Blockchain Record
